# Social image branding (Facebook + Instagram)

Applies to **every** Autopilot / ML Social / Zernio campaign: `today`, `week`, `week_ahead`, `spotlight`.

Every Sacred Ground social graphic **must** include:

1. **Sacred Ground circular logo** — `config/brand/sacred-ground-logo-circle-transparent.png`
2. **Clean photo** — no event/campaign text painted over the image
3. **Cream footer band under the photo** with campaign/event copy + website + phone (always)

## No text over the photo (required — all posts)

- Do **not** place campaign words, event titles, times, or location over the photo
- Photo area = image + translucent circular logo only
- All readable copy goes in the cream footer under the photo
- This is mandatory for Today, This Week, Next 7 Days, and Spotlight alike

## Footer band (required — always)

- Extend the canvas below the photo (cream/light band)
- Always include, centered and readable in black ink on cream:
  - Campaign word (`TODAY` / `THIS WEEK` / `NEXT 7 DAYS` / `SPOTLIGHT`)
  - Who / what (event title(s) or visit line — keep short)
  - Day·time · Arlington Heights (as fits)
  - `shopsacredground.com`
  - `847-749-3922`
- Never place website/phone over busy photo areas (crystals, runes, faces, product)

## Type style (required)

- Mix fonts (chunky + hand + one script accent) — avoid one rigid template font everywhere
- **Readability first:** thick/bold type, true black on the cream footer — **no white border/stroke/halo**
- Feel original / shop-made, not store-bought Canva template

## Layout (required)

| Zone | Content |
|---|---|
| **Photo** | Specialty / rotation / store / event image + circular logo (bottom-left of photo) |
| **Below photo** | Campaign word + event lines + website + phone |

## Logo

- Circular only; strip black/square background to true transparency
- **Darker translucent** — about **80–90% opacity** (a smidge darker than a faint watermark; still not fully opaque)
- Corner mark ~10–13% of image width; prefer bottom-left of the **photo** area (above footer)

## Caption (platform text under the post)

- Warm experience language + clickable booking/event link
- Phone/site may also appear in caption; footer on the graphic is still required

## Campaign backgrounds

- **today** — image rules library / specialty / rotation / store exterior
- **week** — event or store image
- **week_ahead** — Sacred Ground store photo
- **spotlight** — event featured or store fallback
- All of the above still get the same footer layout (no text over photo)
